{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.398193359375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Regression analysis suggests that changing to a 6-month regimen would significantly reduce failure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.421875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "and acquired drug resistance rates, in addition to relapse rates.  This analysis found that regimens  4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4408569335938,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "with 5–7 months of rifampicin have 0.43 times the failure rate, and 0.32 times the relapse rate of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4464111328125,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "regimens with 1–2 months of rifampicin. Among the failures and relapses from regimens with 5–7",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3827514648438,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "months of rifampicin, the rate of acquired drug resistance is 0.28 times that of the regimens with 1–2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        167.6033935546875,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "months of rifampicin.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.575439453125,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "Patients with isoniazid resistance would realize major benefits if the 2-month rifampicin regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.44775390625,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "were replaced with a 6-month regimen. Among patients with isoniazid monoresistance at the start",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.38818359375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "of treatment, 38% relapsed after treatment with 2-month rifampicin regimens, which is significantly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.3827514648438,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "higher than the 5.5% relapse rate after treatment with 6-month rifampicin regimens. Thus, changing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4376831054688,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "to the 6-month rifampicin regimen would avert 325 relapses per 1000 patients who start treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        182.7635955810547,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "with isoniazid resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.4332275390625,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "Even for patients with pansusceptible TB, the proportion who relapsed after the 2-month rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        524.409423828125,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "regimen was 8.2%, which was significantly higher than the 3.1% for the 6-month rifampicin regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.70257568359375,
        527.4835205078125,
        292.1455993652344
      ],
      "text": "When the first course of therapy is considered along with retreatment for patients who fail or relapse,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993047714233398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.902587890625,
        527.3827514648438,
        305.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "it is estimated that the 6-month rifampicin regimen would avert between 3 and 12 deaths per 1000",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.10247802734375,
        527.39697265625,
        318.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "compared with the 2-month rifampicin regimen across seven countries modelled with a range of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.302490234375,
        527.40576171875,
        331.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "drug resistance among new patients. In addition, 0.6–4.4 failures and relapses with drug resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.3761596679688,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "other than MDR-TB would be averted per 1000 TB patients, but an additional 0.6–1.3 MDR-TB cases",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        166.17007446289062,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "would be generated.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.406494140625,
        527.41455078125,
        379.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "Among patients who failed or relapsed after their first course of treatment containing 6 months of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.60650634765625,
        527.4398803710938,
        393.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin, regression analysis found a reduction in overall acquired drug resistance; however, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.8065185546875,
        527.38720703125,
        406.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "pattern of acquired drug resistance was different from that in patients who received the 2-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.0065002441406,
        527.2042236328125,
        419.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin regimen. The risk of acquiring drug resistance other than MDR-TB is higher with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2065124511719,
        527.423583984375,
        432.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "2-month rifampicin regimen, but the risk of acquiring MDR-TB is higher with the 6-month rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.406494140625,
        527.5073852539062,
        445.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "regimen. Among failures, the proportion with MDR-TB is predicted to be 4–56% after initial treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979580879211426,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.60650634765625,
        527.4299926757812,
        459.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "with the 2-month rifampicin regimen but 50–94% after initial treatment with the regimen containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.8065185546875,
        176.28350830078125,
        472.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "6 months of rifampicin.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.62371826171875,
        209.15652465820312,
        501.4757080078125
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.68359375,
        527.515380859375,
        523.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "The interactions of rifampicin with antiretroviral therapy (ART) are of concern. Switching to the 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952045440673828,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.8836669921875,
        527.5806884765625,
        536.32666015625
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin regimen means that these drug interactions must be taken into account for the full 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.0836181640625,
        527.4552001953125,
        549.526611328125
      ],
      "text": "months rather than for just the first 2 months of therapy. However, the 6-month rifampicin regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.0076904296875,
        503.8764953613281,
        562.7266845703125
      ],
      "text": "(8) has marked benefits for persons living with HIV, and the drug interactions can be managed  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.1008911132812,
        245.23455810546875,
        591.9529418945312
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.1608276367188,
        527.6216430664062,
        613.6038208007812
      ],
      "text": "To help minimize the acquisition of MDR-TB, it is critically important that national TB control",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.36083984375,
        527.429931640625,
        626.8038330078125
      ],
      "text": "programmes ensure adequate supervision of rifampicin. Implementing patient supervision for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.560791015625,
        527.4057006835938,
        640.0037841796875
      ],
      "text": "4-month continuation phase will require additional resources in areas where the continuation phase",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.7608032226562,
        527.3969116210938,
        653.2037963867188
      ],
      "text": "has been self-administered – an investment that may be offset by the savings from relapses (and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.9608154296875,
        527.57080078125,
        666.40380859375
      ],
      "text": "therefore retreatments) averted. In 2008, 23 countries (including four that are considered high-burden)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956714630126953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        665.1608276367188,
        527.4035034179688,
        679.6038208007812
      ],
      "text": "still used the 2-month rifampicin regimen for their new patients. These countries reported 706 905",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.36083984375,
        395.4618835449219,
        692.8038330078125
      ],
      "text": "new cases in 2007, or 13% of the global new TB notifications that year.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        762.6718139648438,
        504.34552001953125,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "The difference in failure and acquired drug resistance was not statistically significant in these three randomized controlled trials. 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.293800354003906,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "8 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
